OL,3,GNEWSAFinal attempt to save disabled
OL,4,Aadults centre fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FA last ditch attempt to save a day
OL,7,Fcentre for adults with disabilities has
OL,8,Fbeen unsuccessful.
OL,10,FOn 17 September it was announced that
OL,11,FWellington House in Brighton which
OL,12,Foffers care to 21 people, would be shut
OL,13,Fto save #336,000 a year.
OL,15,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,16,FReporting Service, an attempt to have
OL,17,Fthe closure decision called in by
OL,18,Fopposition councillors at Brighton &
OL,19,FHove City Council (BHCC) was
OL,20,Funsuccessful.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
